{
  "slug": "mind-glaive",
  "name": "Mind Glaive",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Eliminate context rot in Claude Code with intelligent memory hierarchy, auto-learning hooks, and specialized subagents. Uses an 8-layer memory architecture with SessionStart/End hooks that automatically persist and restore context across sessions. Includes an MCP knowledge base, pattern learning from tool usage, and pre-compaction memory compression to keep Claude informed without bloating context.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**, **4 agents**, **6 commands**, **1 hook** and **2 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `context-maintenance` (Weekly cleanup and optimization of project memory - archives old decisions, consolidates rules, removes stale sections), `mind-glaive-setup` (Initialize mind-glaive for a project with one command), `pattern-learning` (Auto-learns from correction patterns - generates rules after 3+ occurrences of same correction)\n- **Agents** (4): `context-cleaner` (Analyzes project memory for outdated, redundant, or bloated information and recommends cleanup actions), `doc-miner` (Discovers undocumented patterns and conventions from codebase, suggests new rules), `README`, `test-runner` (Executes tests and build commands, capturing detailed output while summarizing results for main context)\n- **Commands** (6): `policy` (Get or set the mind-glaive update policy (auto | nudge | off)), `README`, `relink` (Re-run the skill linker — refresh symlinks from node_modules into .claude/skills/), `status` (Display current context health metrics and memory usage statistics), `update` (Update mind-glaive to the latest version (runs npm update + re-links skills)), `welcome` (Welcome to mind-glaive)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (2): `codebase-rag`, `project-kb`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mind-glaive@claude-community` from `TheGlitchKing/mind-glaive`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
